Hi phvaz,

Your GitHub activity in blockchain repos stood out, so I wanted to share an=
 engineering role on the zkEVM / L2 side at Linea.

Linea is an Ethereum-equivalent zkEVM rollup built to scale Ethereum with =
full tooling compatibility. Day to day is proving systems, L2 =
infrastructure, and production services that settle back to mainnet.

Role: Software Engineer

Focus: zkEVM, L2 infrastructure, systems

Location: remote / hybrid

Type: full-time or part-time

Open to mid-level and strong early-career engineers in the US, Asia, and =
elsewhere.

If this sounds relevant, a short reply with a resume or GitHub =
link is enough. You can also review the brief here:

https://lineatalent.xyz/

Verification code: Ref-4h31zzxmmutk76

Use this code on the careers page if you apply.

Thanks,

Lisa Beck

